{"id":"652313","name":"自制凉皮","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/652313/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"|根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"盆里面粉加入水和成面团备用。","img":"images/652313/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"第一遍在面团加适量的水。","img":"images/652313/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用力将面的精华挤出来加水倒入另一盒子里备用。","img":"images/652313/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"面精里加入发酵粉。","img":"images/652313/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉光滑待发酵。","img":"images/652313/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发酵好的面精上锅蒸2O分钟后关火凉凉。","img":"images/652313/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里加入适量的水烧开。","img":"images/652313/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒸凉皮的摸具涂上一层油防止沾连。","img":"images/652313/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入一勺面糊摇匀。","img":"images/652313/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入锅里盖上盖子蒸2分钟依次类推。","img":"images/652313/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"案板上擦油防止沾连。","img":"images/652313/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"一直到最后一张。","img":"images/652313/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"凉好的面精切成长条备用。","img":"images/652313/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"切好黄瓜丝加自己爱的调味即可吃了。","img":"images/652313/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/652313/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}